"Research. <a "
"href=\"http://www.ngdc.noaa.gov/ecosys/cdroms/ged_iia/datasets/a04/lw.htm\">http://www.ngdc.noaa.gov/ecosys/cdroms/ged_iia/datasets/a04/lw.htm</a></li><li>CRU"
