"resolution data set of surface climate over global land areas. Climate "
"Research 21.<a "
"href=\"https://crudata.uea.ac.uk/cru/data/hrg\">https://crudata.uea.ac.uk/cru/data/hrg</a></li></ul></p>"
msgstr ""
