"Geographic (lat/long) 361x721 grid (centroid-registered on .5 degree "
"meridians). Boulder CO: National Center for Atmospheric Research. <a "
"href=\"http://www.ngdc.noaa.gov/ecosys/cdroms/ged_iia/datasets/a04/lw.htm\">http://www.ngdc.noaa.gov/ecosys/cdroms/ged_iia/datasets/a04/lw.htm</a></li><li>CRU"
" CL 2.0: New, M., Lister, D., Hulme, M. and Makin, I., 2002: A high-"
